<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/19/eng@/~chp_II__cl_10> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 60i of the principal Act is amended by inserting after subsection (3) the following subsection: “(3a) For the purposes of subsections (1) and (3), the company referred to in those sections shall include a unit trust which is approved by the Securities Commission as Real Estate Investment Trust or Property Trust Fund.”. Amendment of section 75b"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/19/eng@> .
